###
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----MyAwesomeBoundary

------MyAwesomeBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="language"

es
------MyAwesomeBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="conversationHistory"

[{"role":"recruiter", "text": "Hola, bienvenido a la entrevista. ¿Estás listo?"}]
------MyAwesomeBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="audio"; filename="Convai_Conversation_20260407_233542.wav"
Content-Type: audio/wav

< ./Convai_Conversation_20260407_233542.wav
------MyAwesomeBoundary--


### 2B. Listar el historial de sesiones (Para las gráficas de progreso)
GET {{baseUrl}}/sessions?limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 2C. Obtener los detalles completos de UNA sesión
# 🎯 REEMPLAZA EL sessionId CON EL ID QUE OBTUVISTE EN EL PASO 2A O 2B
@sessionId = tu-session-id-aqui

GET {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 2D. Eliminar una sesión
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}